### Review book 4 (201 the first time; there's no delete yet, so 409 after that)
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/4/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rating": 4, "text": "Practical and timeless." }

### Review the same book again (409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/4/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rating": 5 }

### Rating out of range (400, with errors.rating)
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/5/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rating": 7 }

### Missing rating (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/5/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{ }

### Unknown book (404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/999/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rating": 3 }